
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Practice Path | Python Lab</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#0b1120;color:#e5e7eb;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding:20px}
main{max-width:760px;margin:auto}
header{padding:18px 0 25px}
.tag{color:#38bdf8;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px}
h1{font-size:32px;margin:12px 0}
p{line-height:1.65;color:#a5b4c8}
.card{background:#172238;border:1px solid #283751;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;margin:18px 0}
h2{font-size:20px;margin-top:0}
.code{background:#080d18;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;color:#7dd3fc;font-family:monospace;font-size:16px;overflow:auto}
.options{display:grid;gap:10px}
.option{padding:14px;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:10px;background:#101a2c;color:#e5e7eb;text-align:left;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer}
.option.selected{border-color:#38bdf8;background:#19304a}
button{cursor:pointer;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;background:#38bdf8;color:#07111f;font-weight:bold;width:100%;margin-top:12px}
button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
.small{font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8}
#feedback{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:14px;display:none;line-height:1.5}
.bar{height:8px;background:#334155;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden}
#fill{height:100%;width:0;background:#38bdf8;transition:width .3s}
footer{text-align:center;color:#64748b;padding:25px;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header>
<div class="tag">LEARN • PREDICT • EXPERIMENT</div>
<h1>Practice Path</h1>
<p>Don't just watch code. Understand it, predict it, and practice it.</p>
</header>

<section class="card">
<h2>Python Starter Lab</h2>
<p class="small">Checkpoint 1 · Understanding print()</p>
<div class="bar"><div id="fill"></div></div>
<p id="progressText">0 of 1 checkpoints completed</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>01 — Learn</h2>
<p>Python mein <b>print()</b> function screen par text ya output dikhane ke liye use hota hai.</p>
<div class="code">print("Hello World")</div>
<p>Yahan <b>Hello World</b> text screen par display hoga. Text ko quotation marks ke andar likha gaya hai.</p>
</section>

<section class="card" id="challenge">
<h2>02 — Predict</h2>
<p>Code run hone par kya output aayega?</p>
<div class="code">print("I am learning Python")</div>

<div class="options" id="choices">
<button class="option" data-answer="a">Python</button>
<button class="option" data-answer="b">I am learning Python</button>
<button class="option" data-answer="c">print</button>
</div>

<button id="submit" disabled>Check My Prediction</button>
<div id="feedback"></div>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>03 — Explain</h2>
<p>Socho: print() ka kaam kya hai? Text ko quotation marks ke andar kyon likha?</p>
<p class="small">Apne words mein answer sochna. Explanation tumhari understanding test karne ke liye hai.</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>04 — Checkpoint</h2>
<p id="status">Complete the prediction to unlock this checkpoint.</p>
<button id="complete" disabled>Complete Checkpoint</button>
<button id="reset" style="background:#334155;color:white">Reset Progress</button>
</section>

<footer>Practice Path · Learn by doing</footer>
</main>

<script>
const choices=document.querySelectorAll(".option");
const submit=document.getElementById("submit");
const feedback=document.getElementById("feedback");
const complete=document.getElementById("complete");
const statusText=document.getElementById("status");
const fill=document.getElementById("fill");
const progressText=document.getElementById("progressText");

let selected=null;
let checked=false;
let finished=localStorage.getItem("practicePathCheckpoint1")==="true";

function updateProgress(){
  fill.style.width=finished?"100%":"0%";
  progressText.textContent=finished?"1 of 1 checkpoints completed":"0 of 1 checkpoints completed";
  statusText.textContent=finished?"Checkpoint completed! Your progress is saved on this device.":"Complete the prediction to unlock this checkpoint.";
  complete.textContent=finished?"Checkpoint Completed ✓":"Complete Checkpoint";
  complete.disabled=!checked||finished;
}

choices.forEach(button=>{
  button.addEventListener("click",()=>{
    if(checked)return;
    choices.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove("selected"));
    button.classList.add("selected");
    selected=button.dataset.answer;
    submit.disabled=false;
  });
});

submit.addEventListener("click",()=>{
  if(!selected||checked)return;
  checked=true;
  feedback.style.display="block";
  if(selected==="b"){
    feedback.innerHTML="Correct! print() displays the text inside the quotation marks. You predicted the output correctly.";
    feedback.style.background="#12332c";
    feedback.style.color="#a7f3d0";
  }else{
    feedback.innerHTML="Not quite. print() displays the text written inside its parentheses and quotation marks. The correct output is: I am learning Python";
    feedback.style.background="#3b2630";
    feedback.style.color="#fecdd3";
  }
  choices.forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);
  submit.disabled=true;
  complete.disabled=false;
  statusText.textContent="Prediction checked. You can now complete this checkpoint.";
});

complete.addEventListener("click",()=>{
  if(!checked||finished)return;
  finished=true;
  localStorage.setItem("practicePathCheckpoint1","true");
  updateProgress();
});

document.getElementById("reset").addEventListener("click",()=>{
  localStorage.removeItem("practicePathCheckpoint1");
  location.reload();
});

if(finished){
  checked=true;
  choices.forEach(b=>{
    b.disabled=true;
    if(b.dataset.answer==="b")b.classList.add("selected");
  });
  feedback.style.display="block";
  feedback.textContent="Previously completed. Your progress is saved on this device.";
  feedback.style.background="#12332c";
  feedback.style.color="#a7f3d0";
  submit.disabled=true;
}
updateProgress();
</script>
</body>
</html>
